WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.545
June twenty-sixteen.

00:00:01.545 --> 00:00:03.000
Bill C-14.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.647
They promised safeguards.

00:00:04.647 --> 00:00:06.931
Death had to be reasonably foreseeable.

00:00:06.931 --> 00:00:09.909
One thousand and eighteen people died in year one.

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:13.363
And then they started dismantling every single safeguard they wrote.
